  "name": "Phantylia's Proverb",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Phantylia%27s_Proverb",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-08-11T08:16:27.072Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The words of wisdom left here by the Lord Ravager known as \"Phantylia\":"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Hehe, I know you can see me. Go on, guess. What do you think I'm hoping to witness here?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A genius's mind, destroyed by its own creator?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A hollow Scepter, catching the glance from a new god?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A newborn Overlord, bestowing the glorious flames of ruin upon the cosmos?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Oh, the drama!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But no, that's not quite it. Or rather, that's not all I care about."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Does the coronation or downfall of a fellow Lord truly matter so much?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "What I'm hoping for from all this \"Trailblazing\" is one... grand... show."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The universe, in all its forms, is just a play. And a play needs its twists and turns to have any real flavor, don't you think?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-a027b50e0af3b54f"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
